  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultivar Coffees Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultivar Peru engages in long-term partnerships with coffee farmers. With this DGGF-TA project the knowledge and capacity of coffee growers has been improved. Project Specialty Coffee Peru: the objective of this project is to increase the knowledge and capacities of a group of coffee growers with whom we, Cultivar Coffees, have entered into a long-term trade relationship (since 2017). It concerns improving the production and processing of quality coffee (specialty coffee). This objective contributes to the greater joint vision of both the farmers and Cultivar Coffees: realising collaborations between all chain partners, whereby the farmers have long-term access to the specialty coffee market, and are able to implement a sustainable and profitable business model without being dependent from external financing.</narrative>
  </description>
